                            <div class="two-column-project">
                                <div>
                                    <p>Lightbringer is a 2D platformer using light as its main mechanic.</p>
                                    <p>Status: Completed (5/19/2026)</p>
                                    <p>Dev Time: approx. 2 Months.</p>
                                    <p>Engine: Godot 4.6 (GDScript)</p>
                                </div>
                                <img src="/images/project-images/lightbringer/lightbringer-cover.png" alt="">
                            </div>

