                    <div class="project-background">
                        <h2 class="title-background"><a href="https://jachimaru.github.io/fishy-shooter">Fishy Shooter</a></h2>
                        <div class="stacked-content">
                            <div class="two-column-project">
                                <div>
                                    <p>A top-down 2D shooter. The player plays as a fish and can choose different attack and movement options and fights through waves of enemies.</p>
                                    <p>Status: Completed (09/01/2026)</p>
                                    <p>Dev Time: Approx. 7 weeks.</p>
                                    <p>Langauge: Vanilla JavaScript and Canvas</p>
                                </div>
                                <img src="/images/project-images/fishy-shooter/screenshot-1.png" alt="">
                            </div>

                            <div class="columned-content">
                                <img src="/images/project-images/fishy-shooter/screenshot-4.png" alt="">
                                <img src="/images/project-images/fishy-shooter/screenshot-5.png" alt="">
                                <img src="/images/project-images/fishy-shooter/screenshot-7.png" alt="">
                                <img src="/images/project-images/fishy-shooter/screenshot-8.png" alt="">
